# INTERIM — sol pen-test Finding #6 (session-94).
# This file is a denylist mirror, not proof that an image is free of local
# secrets or internal state. Full closure is deferred to a focused pass:
# replace `COPY .` with positive allowlisted COPY declarations (or generate an
# equivalently allowlisted context), clean-build/start the image, then inspect
# every `docker save` layer for forbidden material.
# Discuss record: .claude/handoffs/session-94-sol-discuss-round1.md

# Don't bloat the Docker build context.
# Mirrors .gitignore plus build artifacts the image regenerates.

.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea
.wrangler/

# Python build artifacts
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.egg-info/
.venv
.venv*
venv
venv_*

